          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Refractory, fireclay, packed, at plant
na;
Synonyms: Keramik, Ofenausmauerung, ceramics, lining; 
UUID: 76b3d094-2608-32f8-8be6-7b68317004f0
